7	+/**
8	+ * tasks-api-integration — T5 Regression and browser/network QA
9	+ *
10	+ * Checklist items covered:
11	+ *   [x] Task Mode calls GET /api/workspaces/:workspaceId/features?include=tasks
12	+ *   [x] Task Mode includes status, title, query, page, limit, sort=task_id_asc
13	+ *   [x] Task Mode reads updated_at from embedded backend task items
14	+ *   [x] Task Mode reads feature-list pagination from data.page, data.limit, data.total
15	+ *   [x] Task Mode does NOT expect task_page or has_more
16	+ *   [x] TanStack Query uses 60-second cache window and refetchInterval: 60_000
17	+ *   [x] Feature Mode does NOT switch to the combined response unintentionally
18	+ *   [x] Existing /tasks consumers still work and receive updated_at
19	+ *   [n] Browser/network QA against live backend — see QA_NOTES block at bottom
20	+ *
21	+ * QA_NOTES:
22	+ *   Backend T1 (add updated_at to /tasks) and T2 (add /features?include=tasks)
23	+ *   must be deployed before live network QA can pass.
24	+ *   At the time of this PR the backend tasks are merged but the deployment
25	+ *   status is unknown. Live QA items below are documented as manual checks:
26	+ *
27	+ *   - Navigate to the board in Task Mode.
28	+ *   - Open DevTools → Network.
29	+ *   - Confirm a request to /features?include=tasks is issued on load.
30	+ *   - Confirm sort=task_id_asc, page=1, limit=50, status=... appear in the URL.
31	+ *   - Confirm response JSON contains data.page, data.limit, data.total,
32	+ *     data.features[].tasks[].updated_at.
33	+ *   - Confirm NO task_page or has_more field in the response.
34	+ *   - Switch to Feature Mode and confirm no /features?include=tasks request fires.
35	+ *   - Call GET /api/workspaces/:workspaceId/tasks and confirm updated_at is present
36	+ *     on every returned task item.
37	+ *
38	+ *   If the backend is not yet deployed, the above checks cannot pass in a live
39	+ *   environment and this PR must remain gated until backend deployment completes.
40	+ */
